        "text": "=🥗 Welcome to Dibs n8n Test Bot!  \nI'm your AI nutritionist. Tell me what you ate, and I'll estimate the calories and macros for you.\n\n🍽️ /add Log a meal and get its estimated nutrition.  \n\n📊 /tracker See your total calories, protein, carbs and fat for today.  \n\n💡 Example:  /add 2 eggs and 2 rotis with dal  I'll identify the foods, estimate their nutrition, save them to your meal log and show you the total macros.  \n\n⚠️ Nutrition values are estimates and may vary depending on ingredients, preparation and portion size.  \n\n💪 Eat well. Track better.",
